@startuml
hide footbox
autonumber
title To add a publication genre to the genre list

actor Administrator
participant ":MiteLovers" as UI

Administrator -> UI : I want to add a new genre to the official list
activate UI
UI --> Administrator : What is the genre name?
deactivate UI
Administrator -> UI : genreType("Drama")
activate UI
UI --> Administrator : Genre successfully added!
deactivate UI

@enduml